  behaviourSummary: Bury it before its sigils burn out - or it takes a life
  vaultDescription: 'It lands hexed and counting: while its top is open to the sky,
    every brick you place burns one sigil. When the last sigil dies, so does one
    of your lives - and the count begins again. Entomb it under a brick to silence
    the hex; dig it up and it wakes counting.'
